                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="driftwood, dried grass, etc. Then the house-master would take an axe and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-103_l37" HPOS="399" VPOS="2591" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="401 2628 2171 2622" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="401 2628 401 2640 988 2649 989 2649 991 2649 1019 2638 2167 2638 2171 2622 2167 2593 399 2591 401 2628"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="break one of his sledges, or cut down one of the wooden house-supports at"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-103_l38" HPOS="401" VPOS="2641" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="403 2684 2171 2678" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="403 2684 403 2700 2169 2696 2171 2678 2167 2653 1956 2653 1929 2641 1927 2641 1925 2641 1923 2641 1882 2651 1831 2641 1829 2641 1773 2651 1457 2643 1455 2643 1389 2653 1360 2643 1358 2643 1356 2643 1354 2643 1317 2653 1266 2643 1264 2643 1077 2653 991 2643 989 2643 988 2643 958 2655 639 2645 637 2645 586 2655 520 2645 518 2645 516 2645 481 2655 420 2645 418 2645 416 2645 415 2645 401 2653 403 2684"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the risk of its tumbling down on our heads. When we remember how scarce"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-103_l39" HPOS="401" VPOS="2702" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="403 2745 2171 2741" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="403 2745 403 2758 2169 2756 2171 2741 2169 2714 2126 2702 2124 2702 2122 2702 2120 2702 2083 2712 1878 2702 1876 2702 1874 2702 1872 2702 1857 2712 1831 2702 1829 2702 1828 2702 1752 2712 1724 2702 1722 2702 1720 2702 1718 2702 1697 2712 1625 2702 1623 2702 1621 2702 1599 2712 1572 2702 1570 2702 1568 2702 1449 2712 1360 2702 1358 2702 1268 2714 1216 2704 1214 2704 1212 2704 1184 2714 1003 2704 1001 2704 945 2714 917 2704 915 2704 913 2704 912 2704 878 2714 830 2704 828 2704 781 2714 726 2704 724 2704 722 2704 721 2704 705 2716 594 2716 508 2704 506 2704 401 2716 403 2745"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="wood is on the Arctic shore, and especially wood that is suitable for poles"/>
                    </TextLine>

