                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="401 2807 401 2821 2169 2817 2171 2801 2169 2774 2132 2762 2130 2762 2128 2762 2056 2772 1648 2762 1646 2762 1578 2774 1551 2764 1549 2764 1547 2764 1360 2774 1307 2764 1305 2764 1303 2764 1272 2774 1192 2764 1190 2764 951 2776 469 2766 467 2766 399 2778 401 2807"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and house-supports, we can appreciate the real value of such a sacrifice. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

